    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Mystical Puzzle Adventure Beyond Reality</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ved, an ordinary young man, receives a mysterious package containing an ancient map of the Himalayas. Following its trail, he discovers a hidden cave and a colossal cube of unknown origin. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/3b73caac6ace550af708da4f9e3c2689.avif?t=1745389035\" width=800 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The moment he touches it, everything changes\u2014Ved is transformed into a cube and transported into a surreal, enigmatic dimension where reality bends, and ancient powers lie dormant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/d644242850f692fd3c9c6d0a337070ec.poster.avif?t=1745389035\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/d644242850f692fd3c9c6d0a337070ec.webm?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/d644242850f692fd3c9c6d0a337070ec.mp4?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this <strong>atmospheric puzzle-adventure</strong>, players must navigate a vast, cubic world filled with secrets, challenges, and hidden knowledge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/733a5a156b96e35ef0bfe6a204625e57.poster.avif?t=1745389035\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/733a5a156b96e35ef0bfe6a204625e57.webm?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/733a5a156b96e35ef0bfe6a204625e57.mp4?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Become the Cube</strong> \u2013 Control Ved in his transformed state, rolling and shifting through intricate environments where each side of the cube presents unique mechanics and abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Solve Mind-Bending Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Manipulate the cubic world, activate ancient mechanisms, and harness elemental powers to overcome obstacles and unlock new paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Explore a Dynamic, Evolving World</strong> \u2013 Traverse six visually distinct chapters, each featuring environments that shift and evolve as Ved\u2019s journey unfolds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Master Elemental Abilities</strong> \u2013 Unlock powerful new skills that allow deeper exploration and more complex challenges as Ved gains knowledge of his transformation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/66126af7bef1c113fe06e891eb79551d.poster.avif?t=1745389035\" width=636 height=358 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/66126af7bef1c113fe06e891eb79551d.webm?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/66126af7bef1c113fe06e891eb79551d.mp4?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>Unravel an Enigmatic Story</strong> \u2013 Inspired by <strong>Hindu mythology</strong>, the game weaves an emotional tale of self-discovery, mystery, and fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd37 <strong>A Visually Transformative Experience</strong> \u2013 Begin in dark, ominous landscapes and gradually transition into bright, vibrant realms, mirroring Ved\u2019s personal growth and the secrets he uncovers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/a81b3cd271eb9a03857a7c5bd73414ca.poster.avif?t=1745389035\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/a81b3cd271eb9a03857a7c5bd73414ca.webm?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3246430/extras/a81b3cd271eb9a03857a7c5bd73414ca.mp4?t=1745389035\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Ved delves deeper into the mysteries of the cube, the world shifts, challenges intensify, and the truth behind his transformation is revealed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you escape the cube\u2019s grasp, or become one with its power?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dare to enter <strong>VED: Journey Beyond the Cube</strong>. The path is yours to shape.</p>",
